            }
            : print "You see what's going on here, and while you hear some crying about how people don't want to be called trash, you set them straight saying, that sort of thing is trash, not the people, and you can do better if you'd be bothered. They feel very insulted by this, and they assure you that it's this sort of behavior though will make them spew even more hateful speech to the next person, who's even less able to take it than you, and you should feel very very guilty about it. But thankfully, you'll get to do so on your own time, since the voice dissipates. You can now go all four ways." ;
            : set_integer var="tempint" "5" ;
            : set_true "point_hate_rash" ;
